{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvaocsTjA1c7EkVGLdSM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't commit to the rewrite yet, and don't run the diary study as designed. Do a small, time-boxed check that can end in \"sunset.\"**\n\n**Why not the diary study:**\n- It answers \"what could widgets be?\" The decision you face is \"is this widget worth about five weeks plus ongoing QA?\" Those are different questions.\n- The only people you can recruit are the 1.1% who adopted. They're self-selected, so they tell you little about why 99% didn't.\n- Nothing in the data suggests a latent need. Adoption is low, and retention is flat against matched users. The matching has limits, but it gives you no evidence of value.\n- The study costs weeks and may only produce interesting insights, not a decision.\n\n**What the costs look like:** A rewrite costs 5 weeks, and QA costs about 3 days per iOS release indefinitely. Both go to a feature that so far hasn't shown it moves retention or anything else.\n\n**What I'd do instead (about a week of analysis):**\n1. Pull what you already have. How often do widget users tap through or log habits from the widget? Do they log more often than matched users, even if they don't retain better? Which widget sizes get used?\n2. Check whether widgets support a strategic bet, such as a planned acquisition or engagement push, that the current data wouldn't show.\n3. Set a decision rule up front. For example, rewrite only if widget users show clearly higher logging frequency or there's a concrete plan to grow adoption. Otherwise let the widget retire with the API and tell the affected users.\n4. Set a decision date that leaves five weeks plus buffer before the API retires.\n\n**If a rewrite looks justified:** Run a small study then, focused on non-adopters and lapsed widget users, and scope the rewrite to what that study finds.\n\nMy default, absent new evidence, is to sunset."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3453,"cache_read_input_tokens":5037,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3453},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ea1492ff-1acd-42e7-81c9-fec2e2ae8d64","uuid":"3f52ae85-0347-4c51-8146-aa754d117fe4","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:10:23.762Z","request_id":"req_011CfvaoccqExpTDMQsPbBmz"}
